00:22:25.080 --> 00:22:26.927
I'll take care of it, I'll handle it.

531
00:22:26.927 --> 00:22:28.663
Dwelling on that in an unhealthy way.

532
00:22:29.900 --> 00:22:31.510
You know, and it's like allowing your kid

533
00:22:31.510 --> 00:22:35.330
to experience their painful emotions is necessary.

534
00:22:35.330 --> 00:22:38.950
But as a parent, it's also like a form of psychic torture.

535
00:22:38.950 --> 00:22:41.140
No parent wants to see their child in pain.

536
00:22:41.140 --> 00:22:45.780
No, isn't that the worst, isn't that the hardest thing

537
00:22:45.780 --> 00:22:47.828
