538
00:22:47.828 --> 00:22:49.178
Really hard, really hard.

539
00:22:50.550 --> 00:22:53.400
So that's what you have to look forward to, Adam.

540
00:22:53.400 --> 00:22:55.853
So it gets more complicated is what you're saying?

541
00:22:56.840 --> 00:22:57.673
Yes.

542
00:22:59.390 --> 00:23:01.620
Yes it does, it definitely does.

543
00:23:01.620 --> 00:23:04.310
So when, so, but even like

