00:23:08.060 --> 00:23:10.330
for you, we're gonna see this through, it's a setback.

547
00:23:10.330 --> 00:23:13.040
You can't even really say anything, right?

548
00:23:13.040 --> 00:23:15.440
No, you have to allow them to experience their emotions.

549
00:23:15.440 --> 00:23:16.563
You have to let the pain come through.

550
00:23:16.563 --> 00:23:19.170
And not be the person who's like trying

551
00:23:19.170 --> 00:23:20.638
to get them over it too quickly, or--

552
00:23:20.638 --> 00:23:21.710
Or shield them.

553
00:23:21.710 --> 00:23:23.600
Yeah, but also make sure

554
00:23:23.600 --> 00:23:27.380
that they're not shutting down too much.

555
00:23:27.380 --> 00:23:29.810
It's this weird balance.

556
00:23:29.810 --> 00:23:33.410
And as a dad, like what is the healthy,

557
00:23:33.410 --> 00:23:35.930
kind of masculinity that you can model

558
00:23:39.140 --> 00:23:42.490
and be of maximum support

559
00:23:42.490 --> 00:23:46.460
without being like a hard ass or too much of a softy?

