I devour the work, I love it.

2297
01:41:08.210 --> 01:41:11.930
It's, I think what I was trying to get across was

2298
01:41:11.930 --> 01:41:16.930
that we should also, when we're putting ourselves into those

2299
01:41:16.992 --> 01:41:19.590
I was speaking more for my fellow journalist

2300
01:41:19.590 --> 01:41:21.440
when we put ourselves into situations

2301
01:41:21.440 --> 01:41:23.630
to make sure we know why we're doing it.

2302
01:41:23.630 --> 01:41:26.200
And to make sure that we're not trying

2303
01:41:26.200 --> 01:41:29.610
to make ourselves bigger than, it's not like we go

2304
01:41:29.610 --> 01:41:31.957
into it thinking it's going to be this big thing

2305
01:41:31.957 --> 01:41:33.410
and it's going to save people,

2306
01:41:33.410 --> 01:41:35.780
like don't do it with some sort of Messiah complex.

2307
01:41:35.780 --> 01:41:39.020
I don't think he did, I'm just saying in my own mind,

2308
01:41:39.020 --> 01:41:40.080
sometimes that comes up

2309
01:41:40.080 --> 01:41:42.653
because you're thinking I'm doing this for you,

2310
01:41:45.015 --> 01:41:48.210
source or country, but really we do it for ourselves,

2311
01:41:48.210 --> 01:41:49.730
but we also do it because it's a great way to see the world

2312
01:41:49.730 --> 01:41:53.420
and a great way to share time with people, really is.

2313
01:41:53.420 --> 01:41:56.820
And an opportunity for us to express ourselves

2314
01:41:56.820 --> 01:42:00.400
and to scream and yell and rage and holler and sing,

2315
01:42:00.400 --> 01:42:04.020
all of that, so I respect everyone out there doing it.

2316
01:42:04.020 --> 01:42:05.990
And I think this is a great story.

2317
01:42:05.990 --> 01:42:08.900
Here's a guy that was more of a travel expert,

2318
01:42:08.900 --> 01:42:10.410
a social media travel guy

2319
01:42:10.410 --> 01:42:12.440
who is now like really bringing out

2320
01:42:12.440 --> 01:42:14.913
some of the more interesting stories

2321
01:42:14.913 --> 01:42:16.460
that are coming out of Ukraine.

2322
01:42:16.460 --> 01:42:19.370
And he's doing it through Instagram as far as I know.

2323
01:42:19.370 --> 01:42:23.383
And so big ups to Terrell J Star.

2324
01:42:25.390 --> 01:42:28.400
It is an interesting adventuresome life though.

2325
01:42:28.400 --> 01:42:30.192
Yeah, it is.
You know?

2326
01:42:30.192 --> 01:42:31.210
Yeah, it's great.

2327
01:42:31.210 --> 01:42:33.760
And to be able to be boots-on-the-ground,

2328
01:42:33.760 --> 01:42:36.864
tell stories from a firsthand experience

2329
01:42:36.864 --> 01:42:40.100
and kind of pursue your curiosity.

2330
01:42:40.100 --> 01:42:40.933
Absolutely.

2331
01:42:40.933 --> 01:42:42.657
It's a pretty interesting way to live.

2332
01:42:42.657 --> 01:42:44.810
I've had a gun pointed at me

2333
01:42:44.810 --> 01:42:49.419
in a rough part of Honduras for a story,

2334
01:42:49.419 --> 01:42:54.419
